# Mobile — apps/pos-mobile uses the bare/dev-client Expo workflow (ADR 0001),
# so android/ and ios/ are committed, not regenerated per-machine. Only their
# own build artifacts are ignored (see apps/pos-mobile/android/.gitignore).
.expo/
apps/pos-mobile/android/build/
apps/pos-mobile/android/app/build/
apps/pos-mobile/android/.gradle/
apps/pos-mobile/android/.cxx/
apps/pos-mobile/ios/build/
apps/pos-mobile/ios/Pods/

